2aff242c"]},{"basis":"rule_evaluation","verdict":"contradicted","statement":"Dune 的 maximum interior temperature 未达标","explanation":"Dune 最高温度为 5.2°C > 5.0°C，违反 C-21 规则第二项。","evidence_ids":["p3383b7fe8d094a7b","p67de52f12aff242c"]},{"basis":"rule_evaluation","verdict":"supported","statement":"Reed 的 maximum interior temperature 达标","explanation":"Reed 最高温度为 5.0°C，等于上限，满足 C-21 规则第二项。","evidence_ids":["p3383b7fe8d094a7b","p67de52f12aff242c"]},{"basis":"rule_evaluation","verdict":"supported","statement":"Dune 未通过 C-21 验收","explanation":"Dune 未满足两项条件的 AND 关系，温度超标。","evidence_ids":["p3383b7fe8d094a7b","p67de52f12aff242c"]},{"basis":"rule_evaluation","verdict":"supported","statement":"Reed 通过 C-21 验收","explanation":"Reed 两项指标均满足 C-21 规则，通过验收。","evidence_ids":["p3383b7fe8d094a7b","p67de52f12aff242c"]}]}},{"step":2,"event":"source_validation","output":{"chunk_ids":["chunk:fdef1460cd1d9b9eaed6a1de","chunk:e47897a4e8901e942eefac05","chunk:bb83793f0bb82eb2ac1afeae","chunk:9ed8b1d8b88f9ed651fea03d","chunk:da36feaa3d1ecd0df2111cf4"],"selection":"deterministic_all_observed_sources","snapshot_id":"b3100607-2711-432a-92e5-675ec2c3c317:4","triggered_by":"verify_and_submit_report","documents_sha256":"b4b64aeb6fbd056502b5008a7bcb87ab172863c1065e63693b452a411ef3e141","semantic_entailment_verified":false}},{"event":"review_coverage_slots","output":{"scope":"Bounded explicit overall and enumerated change/retain requests; presence is not semantic coverage or entailment","version":"explicit-request-slots-v3","requested_overall":["Dune 的本次验收总判定。","Reed 的本次验收总判定。"],"added_review_slots":[],"requested_comparisons":[],"semantic_coverage_verified":false}},{"step":2,"event":"stage_started","phase":"review","stage_id":"s5","elapsed_ms":35027.853,"remaining_ms":39972.147,"parent_stage_id":"s4"},{"step":2,"event":"review_started","scope":"same configured model, separate review role; not independent human verification"},{"step":2,"event":"request_started","phase":"review","stage_id":"s5","transport":